factor x^4 - 1
factor x^4 + 4
factor x^5 - x
factor (x^2+2*x+1)^3
gcd x^4-1, x^3-1
lcm x^2-1, x^2-x
resultant x^2-2, x^2-3 in x
discriminant x^3+p*x+q in x
quo x^5-1, x-1 in x
rem x^5-1, x^2-1 in x
divide x^5-1 by x^2-1
apart 1/(x^2-1) in x
solve x^2 = 4 for x
solve x^2 = -1 for x
simplify (x^2-1)/(x-1)
expand (x+1)^10
